 the main container (`custom-service-main`) from starting, leaving the pod in a `Pending` state. The issue stems from a misconfiguration or an unimplemented setup task in the init container. No further tool calls are required, as the faulty component has been isolated. \n\nsubmit_tool\n{"ans": "The root cause of the failure is the `custom-service` pod\'s init container (`hang-init`) being configured to run `sleep infinity`, which intentionally blocks the pod from initializing. This prevents the main container (`custom-service-main`) from starting, leaving the pod in a `Pending` state. The init container\'s infinite sleep suggests a misconfiguration or an intentional pause, likely due to an unimplemented setup task or a deployment error. The faulty component is the `hang-init` init container in the `custom-service` deployment, which must be corrected or removed to allow the pod to proceed with initialization."}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 616, 'prompt_tokens': 7806, 'total_tokens': 8422, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfd08-c485-7060-9d4a-883620719503-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 7806, 'output_tokens': 616, 'total_tokens': 8422}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='e8ea6dd7-5e00-4f8e-af69-678ba9ecee0f'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let me try to figure out what\'s going on here. The user is dealing with a Kubernetes cluster where a specific pod, custom-service, is stuck in a Pending state. The initial steps involved checking the services, pods, and logs to diagnose the issue. \n\nFirst, they used kubectl get services and pods to list all the services and pods in the hotel-reservation namespace. The custom-service pods were found to be in an Init:0/1 state, indicating they were stuck during initialization. Then, they tried to get logs for the previous container but encountered an error because the container wasn\'t found. \n\nNext, they described the pod and found that the init container hang-init was running a sleep infinity command, which is why the pod wasn\'t proceeding. The main container wasn\'t starting because the init container wasn\'t completing. The user then checked the pod\'s YAML configuration and confirmed that the init container was indeed set to sleep indefinitely.\n\nThe root cause seems to be the hang-init container\'s infinite sleep, which is either a misconfiguration or an intentional pause. The user concluded that this init container needs to be corrected or removed to allow the pod to initialize properly. Since the problem was identified, they submitted the answer, and the system ended the process.\n\nNo further tool calls are needed because the faulty component has been identified. The answer was submitted, and the process is complete.\n</think>\n\nThe root cause of the failure has been identified, and the faulty component (the `hang-init` init container in the `custom-service` deployment) has been isolated. No further tool calls are required. The submission has already been made, and the process is complete. \n\nsubmit_tool\n{"ans": "The root cause of the failure is the `custom-service` pod\'s init container (`hang-init`) being configured to run `sleep infinity`, which intentionally blocks the pod from initializing. This prevents the main container (`custom-service-main`) from starting, leaving the pod in a `Pending` state. The init container\'s infinite sleep suggests a misconfiguration or an intentional pause, likely due to an unimplemented setup task or a deployment error. The faulty component is the `hang-init` init container in the `custom-service` deployment, which must be corrected or removed to allow the pod to proceed with initialization."}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 470, 'prompt_tokens': 8936, 'total_tokens': 9406, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfd08-e25e-7b22-85c4-7d9d1809b7af-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 8936, 'output_tokens': 470, 'total_tokens': 9406}), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='b491fff1-3dc5-4f46-be98-d62116794f05')]]
