 pod in a `Pending` state. The init container\'s infinite sleep suggests a misconfiguration or an intentional pause, likely due to an unimplemented setup task or a deployment error. The faulty component is the `hang-init` init container in the `custom-service` deployment, which must be corrected or removed to allow the pod to proceed with initialization."}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 543, 'prompt_tokens': 10997, 'total_tokens': 11540, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfd09-cea0-7f73-9443-9f27f6504f0e-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 10997, 'output_tokens': 543, 'total_tokens': 11540}), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='c1810e4a-6295-4664-8588-f064841560be')]]
